          Trimline was an American treadmill brand of the 1990s and 2000s, and the machines are still turning up in basements and on resale sites. This guide covers who made them, how to identify yours, where parts and manuals still exist, and when a used Trimline is worth the money.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
